WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.360
Eight minutes away.

00:02.060 --> 00:06.097
These are the paths of the four inner planets, and the third dot is home.

00:06.547 --> 00:13.557
Sunlight takes eight minutes and twenty seconds to get there, so we always see the Sun as it was eight minutes ago.

00:14.007 --> 00:19.029
A cloud of gas thrown out by the Sun takes from under a day to several days.
